{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An Annville Junior High School, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the students in the Math Club are in the Science Club, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the students in the Science Club are in the Math Club.  There are 15 students in the Science Club.  How many students are in the Math Club?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e42a6bff33fface831d3cb72e7fd4112f552550.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 36 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the people in the science club of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people are in the Math Club, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0db1dd283caed03e0c98bdfc90f89f4d44a0951.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{5}\\times15=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" /> people are in the both the Math Club and the Science Club.\n</p><p>These <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people make up <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the Math Club.\n</p><p>Setting up a proportion:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e108c134702e07b7c9a92713a096780268c365a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\cdot 1.00 =0.30\\cdot x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"143\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/7/9e78e5322523da0456ea0c6c97a0178c97be0077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{0.3} = 40=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c7c0ba4db96aeb1eaef2380ac7f12712f97a6b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40=\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"24\" /> people in the Math Club.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1p